Z||000003||theogre||05-12-2000||10:36 AM||||The 2 motors run 3 doors. The temperature slide runs the 4th door via a push/pull cable.<P>The motor behind the radio runs 2 doors and has a link off it to each. I've had that one appart. Not to bad to deal with as long as you don't lose the linkage inside the duct when you take them off.<P>The other motor controls one door and has only that one linkage. This is the one we are trying to locate and figure out how to get appart. It's held by the same method as the one behind the radio, it's an issue of getting at the thing.<P>UNfortunatly none of the diagrams or other documents I've seen tell you where the blazes the motors and things actually are.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Brian84SE||05-12-2000||02:07 PM||||It is the one behind my radio that is the problem then.  I see it moving one of the doors.  The link that connects it to the air cond. door must be broken. Maybe I'll take a trip to the junkyard to learn more about it.||||reg||1
